                  {
                    "value": "1) This is a simple radar chart supporting multiple measures plotted over a categorical axis. Also known as a web chart, spider chart, or star chart. Use to display performance metrics for quality improvement."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2) Both field buckets of Radar chart are required."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3) Each new Radar is added when you add new field into \"Y axis\" field bucket."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4) Color of each radar can be customized in format settings pane."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
